WEBVTT

00:10:27.614 --> 00:10:33.251
and put whatever we are working on
as part of the solution.

00:10:34.386 --> 00:10:38.902
Because if our cities continue

00:10:38.926 --> 00:10:40.672
the way they are now,

00:10:41.854 --> 00:10:45.179
a similar catastrophe
will happen again ...

00:10:45.964 --> 00:10:47.452
and again.

00:10:49.531 --> 00:10:52.779
Creating a solution
in these sinking cities

00:10:52.803 --> 00:10:58.429
is like making the impossible possible.

00:10:59.909 --> 00:11:01.059
And for that,